{"id":"dataright","duration":54.01,"voice":"Juniper","segments":[{"t":0,"cap":"An AI describes the chart it is shown. It rarely asks whether the data could be right. That part is yours."},{"t":8.27,"cap":"Ask two questions. First, does the pattern follow the business, or the reporting schedule?"},{"t":16.16,"cap":"Ohio's COVID line rose and fell every week because counties reported on fixed days, not because the virus did."},{"t":25,"cap":"Second, what is one row, and could something be counted twice?"},{"t":30.78,"cap":"In a course file, Tableau's sum added a campus's enrollment once for every section listed. In the crash file, one row is one person, not one crash."},{"t":44.3,"cap":"When a pattern looks too sudden, too regular or too big, ask how the data were collected before you trust the story."}],"items":[{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":0.25,"x":44,"y":30,"h":54,"text":"Is the data right?","d":0.63,"big":true,"color":"red"},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":0.78,"x":44,"y":84,"h":44,"text":"the AI describes the chart;","d":0.95},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":6.42,"x":78,"y":128,"h":44,"text":"the check is yours","d":0.63},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":10.75,"x":44,"y":188,"h":44,"text":"1. the business, or the","d":0.81,"color":"blue"},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":13.54,"x":78,"y":232,"h":44,"text":"reporting schedule?","d":0.67,"color":"blue"},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":16.16,"x":44,"y":276,"h":44,"text":"Ohio COVID: a weekly comb","d":0.88},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":20.98,"x":78,"y":320,"h":44,"text":"from reporting days","d":0.67},{"k":"sketch","page":0,"t":16.16,"name":"comb","box":{"x":500,"y":96,"w":430,"h":414},"phases":[20.98]},{"k":"page","page":1,"t":25},{"k":"hand","page":1,"t":25.25,"x":44,"y":30,"h":54,"text":"2. What is one row?","d":0.67,"big":true,"color":"red"},{"k":"hand","page":1,"t":28.58,"x":44,"y":84,"h":44,"text":"counted twice?","d":0.5},{"k":"hand","page":1,"t":30.78,"x":44,"y":128,"h":44,"text":"course file: SUM added the","d":0.91},{"k":"hand","page":1,"t":34.46,"x"